Source: OpenAlex (OurResearch), https://openalex.org/
API documentation and policy checked 2026-11-17: https://help.openalex.org/api/

Each record preserves the canonical OpenAlex identifier, source URL, retrieval
and source update dates, metadata hash, external classification and attribution.
Research-cluster labels/descriptions are machine-generated upstream per the
OpenAlex Topics documentation. They are not expert-reviewed explanations.

